        "### `agent/guardrails.py`\n",
        "Hard limits applied to every proposal: floor, cap, +/-20% per day, exact daily total."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "5b8f4257",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "5b8f4257",
        "outputId": "96adae7f-3725-4e8c-d0a9-77d974b5a0cb"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
